  "body": "Here's an opportunity for investors, first-home buyers and downsizers to secure one or both of these freehold properties close to the beach.\r\n\r\nBoth homes offer good-sized yards, two bedrooms and one bathroom and the added benefit of a garage- rare with homes in this price bracket.  \r\n\r\nBoth homes are currently tenanted on fixed-term agreements, providing rental income from day one. One tenancy runs through to November 2027, while the other runs through to December 2026, giving investors immediate holding income while considering their longer-term plans. There's also plenty of potential to add value. With some renovation and modernisation, these properties could be transformed and potentially improved further with the addition of a third bedroom, subject to council approval.\r\n\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a solid rental investment, a renovation project, your first step onto the property ladder, or the opportunity to secure both properties, these deserve serious consideration. With freehold titles, beach proximity, existing rental income and genuine value-add potential, opportunities like this are hard to ignore.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are highly motivated and are ready to see these properties sold.\r\nBuy one. Buy both. Add value. Build your portfolio with this 'multi unit' opportunity.",
